The [`docs/`](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/tree/main/docs) directory is the long-form record of this chart ([index](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/README.md)):

- [Architecture decision records](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/adr/README.md): one ADR per design decision above.
- [Roadmap to 1.0](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/roadmap.md): the planned releases, the rejected features and why.
- [Upgrade guide](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/upgrading.md): what to change in your values for each breaking release.
- Guides: [consuming chart-base from a domain umbrella](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/guides/consuming.md),
  [development](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/guides/development.md), [testing](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/guides/testing.md).
- Runbooks: [cutting a release](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/runbooks/release.md),
  [re-publishing a tag](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/runbooks/republish-a-tag.md),
  [rotating the release GitHub App key](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/runbooks/rotate-release-app-key.md),
  [Renovate](https://github.com/jellalshadows/chart-base/blob/main/docs/runbooks/renovate.md).

